cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite the research record below."
title: "Knowing Is Not Doing"
subtitle: "Measuring Execution-Time Governance of Learned Skills in LLM Agents"
abstract: >-
  Muscle Memory V1 is verifier-gated procedural memory for Letta agents, and the
  instrument used to measure it. The research record examines the gap between an
  agent authoring or citing a correct procedure and that procedure actually
  governing its next action, and whether act-time governance changes measured
  behaviour without retraining. Effects are bounded to tested tool-use tasks; the
  work does not establish universal model behaviour or external replication.
type: software
